{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>But if he stands a day or two days, he shall not be avenged.</b> If for one day he is exempt, for two days — all the more so! Rather: a day that is like two days. And which is that? From time to time (Mekhilta)." "<b>He shall not be avenged, for he is his money.</b> The case is different for another who struck him — even if he lingered from time to time before dying, he is liable."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:36.446991835Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}